<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian Stocks to Watch Today - Feb 27.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian Stocks to Watch Today - Feb 27.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Some Australian stocks to watch this morning:</p>
<p>*Mayne Nickless Ltd A$7.558 (-0.042)</p>
<p>Transport, health and logistics group reports lower first half net profit but says is on track for better year result.</p>
<p>*RTZ Corp Plc-CRA Ltd A$19.158 (-0.042)</p>
<p>Mining giant to report 1996 calendar year profit today.</p>
<p>*Newcrest Mining Ltd A$4.90 (-0.025)</p>
<p>Gold miner to announce 1996/97 first half results today.</p>
<p>*News Corp Ltd A$7.08 (-0.01)</p>
<p>Moody's on Wednesday confirmed News Corp's debt ratings following its U.S. satellite television tie-up with EchoStar Satellite Broadcasting on Monday.</p>
<p>*Orbital Engine Corp Ltd A$1.15 (+0.07)</p>
<p>Orbital forms joint venture with German industrial giant Siemens Ag to develop fuel rail assemblies using Orbital's direct fuel injection technology.</p>
<p>*OPSM Protector Ltd A$3.10 (+.05)</p>
<p>Protective equipment maker posts higher 1996/97 first half net profit.</p>
<p>*Village Roadshow Ltd A$4.02 (-0.28)</p>
<p>Village said on Wednesday it expected 1996/97 first half net operating profit to be 25 percent to 30 percent above a year ago result.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
